after:
The supplied parent is navy. With `--ink` missing, the note uses teal.
```css
.theme { color: navy; }
.note {
  color: purple;
  color: var(--ink, teal);
}
```
If `--ink` is set to `12px`, the final color rule becomes invalid. The note then inherits navy from its parent; the earlier purple rule is not retried.
